=== output
flash: the amount goes from 0 (no flash) to 1 (all one color), but it's 2.0
outline: the outline is 1 to 4 pixels thick, but this is 0.0
glow: the glow is 1 to 32 pixels wide, but this is 100.0
drew 3 frames with every effect
